abstract: "Research on uncertainty quantification for retinal optic-cup segmentation. Includes exact bounded conformal risk calibration, synthetic verification, frozen aggregate evidence replay for Chákṣu and RIGA, and reproducible figures on omission, region size, expert disagreement and calibration-label requirements."
